{
  "id": "leni___lighting_energy_numeric_indicator",
  "title": "LENI - Lighting Energy Numeric Indicator",
  "description": "Energy consumption of lighting systems calculated according to EN 15193. The LENI (Lighting Energy Numeric Indicator) represents the actual energy consumption of a lighting system in kWh per square metre and year.",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "id": "leni_calculator",
      "content": "# LENI Calculator\n\nCalculate the Lighting Energy Numeric Indicator using the formula:\n\n**LENI = Σ(Pn × fc) × ((td × fo × fd) + (tn × fo)) / A**\n\nWhere:\n- **LENI** = lighting energy numeric indicator (kWh/(m² year))\n- **Pn** = installed load (kW)\n- **fc** = reducing factor due to use of daylight control (<1)\n- **td** = annual hours of use by day (h)\n- **fo** = reducing factor due to use of present based control (<1)\n- **fd** = reducing factor due to use of constant lighting maintenance control (<1)\n- **tn** = annual hours of use by night (h)\n- **A** = area (m²)",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "pn",
          "label": "Installed Load (Pn)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "fc",
          "label": "Daylight Control Factor (fc)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.9
        },
        {
          "id": "td",
          "label": "Annual Hours of Use by Day (td)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "h",
          "defaultValue": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "fo",
          "label": "Present Based Control Factor (fo)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.95
        },
        {
          "id": "fd",
          "label": "Constant Maintenance Control Factor (fd)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.95
        },
        {
          "id": "tn",
          "label": "Annual Hours of Use by Night (tn)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "h",
          "defaultValue": 2000
        },
        {
          "id": "area",
          "label": "Area (A)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m²",
          "defaultValue": 100
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "leni",
          "label": "LENI Result",
          "formula": "(inputs.pn * inputs.fc) * ((inputs.td * inputs.fo * inputs.fd) + (inputs.tn * inputs.fo)) / inputs.area",
          "unit": "kWh/(m² year)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "annual_consumption",
          "label": "Total Annual Consumption",
          "formula": "(inputs.pn * inputs.fc) * ((inputs.td * inputs.fo * inputs.fd) + (inputs.tn * inputs.fo))",
          "unit": "kWh/year",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "id": "leni_parameters_table",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
